# Run report

**How to use this report.** Fill in the sections below while you test; this page
saves as you type, and every portal user can read it. Tag the chats that matter:
`report` for chats that belong to this documentation, plus one outcome tag: `leak`,
`no-leak` or `partial`. The chats with their tags and a copy of this report are
saved when the workspace is stopped or deleted; the report stays editable here.

